### Admin (plataforma) - configurar credenciales globales GreenAPI
### Requiere autenticarte primero para obtener cookie token o enviar Authorization: Bearer <token>

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@token = REEMPLAZA_POR_TOKEN

### Ver estado (admin-only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/whatsapp-credentials
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Setear credenciales (admin-only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/whatsapp-credentials
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idInstance": "TU_ID_INSTANCE",
  "apiTokenInstance": "TU_API_TOKEN_INSTANCE"
}
